## Notes on decisions the plan didn't state

- An expired entry is a use of neither `set`'s eviction budget nor `size`/`has`; I drop expired entries before eviction and when reading `size`/`has`, which follows "expired entries counting as absent."
- `get` refreshes LRU position but leaves the expiry clock set at insert/replace time, per "each expiring ttlMs after it was set" — the test suite confirms this interpretation.

